  "translation": "Ni i, Adamaden-den, cogo nin na Adonay Yawe ko: kuma kɔnɔw ye — bɛɛ ɲanfan — ani foro baganw bɛɛ ye: “Inuw lajɛ, na, inuw lamɛn a lafan bɛɛ fɛ an ⟨i⟩ saraka kan min n bɛ saraka-ka-di aw ye — saraka bon Yisrayɛl kuluw (Misira jamana tɛ — Yisrayɛl) sanfɛ — aw bɛna sogo dun ani aw bɛna joli min.”",
